    {
      "uid": "zhcn:209cb0117ff17c080e577c51",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "果然，德比是特别的。对于即将挑战的\n<chrname>来说，毫无疑问……——",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed3e647bd211c803fdffbd5abcd0af1ff618a72252bea6ad27b739d523700e94",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0010/storytimeline_400010009.json",
      "json_path": [
