    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82eed6a99ad1b8a1e0e67c6b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不仅仅是赛马界。\n『日本德比』和经典三冠的热度，\n在社会上也日益高涨——",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d9ed82bab29960b7bd140e2dc1e1ed96a7403e2c6fd0759dc2eef658b1a784a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
